sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Edge tracking pipeline
    participant C as Published slot-map cache
    participant I as Camera ingest
    participant P as PostGIS mapper
    participant O as Occupancy state machine
    participant B as Outbox

    E->>C: Load map by camera with ETag
    C-->>E: Map version, calibration version, polygons
    E->>E: Bottom-centre pixel to site-local metres
    E->>E: Provisional polygon.covers(point)
    E->>I: VehicleDetected plus slotObservation
    I->>I: Derive tenant and site from camera credential
    I->>P: Authoritative point and current published map
    P-->>I: Slot assignment or explicit failure
    I->>O: Ordered authoritative observation
    O->>O: Debounce, conflict and transition guards
    alt committed transition
        O->>B: Occupancy, history, domain event and outbox in one transaction
    else hold/no transition
        O-->>I: Last-seen update or failure reason
    end

